+// patch 0113 (Phase 11 iter H opt #2: off-screen tile bbox skip).
+// Forward-decl env helper for the killswitch. When ENABLED, the
+// FG-tilemap loop pre-computes a clipped (mapx, mapy)-rectangle
+// matching the visible window's intersection with the map bounds,
+// then iterates only inside that rectangle -- eliminating the per-
+// iteration OOB bounds check on every tile + skipping OOB tiles
+// entirely (no iterations spent on tiles outside the map). Wave-22.5
+// data shows ~30000 tiles visited / ~1900 drawn per 100 flips
+// (94% wasted iteration); this lever cuts the iteration overhead
+// out. Default OFF (killswitch via SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_TILE_BBOX_SKIP=1).
+// Per-tile rendering correctness preserved (in-bounds path unchanged).
+bool tile_bbox_skip_active();
