+  // per-iteration `(mapx+x) >= 0 && (mapx+x) < map.xsize && ...` OOB
+  // bounds check (always-passes in the clipped range) AND skips OOB
+  // tiles entirely (no iterations spent on tiles outside the map).
+  // Wave-22.5 data: ~30000 tiles visited / ~1900 drawn per 100 flips
+  // (94% wasted iteration); this lever cuts the iteration overhead
+  // out. Default OFF (killswitch -- iter H PLAY2 is the A/B opt-in).
+  //
+  // Wave-25 instrumentation note: when bbox-skip is ON, the visited
+  // count drops by the OOB-skip count vs OFF (no iterations spent on
